{
 "__comment": [
  "context-guru service SLO. Small on purpose: every panel is backed by a series that",
  "actually exists in proxy/promexport.go, plus Prometheus's own `up`.",
  "",
  "The bottom row is the HTTP error-rate SLI, over cg_refused_requests_total. Its",
  "denominator is refused + processed, because a refused request never reaches the",
  "aggregator and so is absent from cg_requests_total."
 ],
