   "title": "Refusals by reason",
   "description": "The same SLI, split by why. Which bar is tall decides who fixes it: rate_limit/concurrency are our limits (429), spend_cap is a budget (402), auth/forbidden is the caller's token, no_upstream is our configuration and upstream_error is the provider. Flat at zero is healthy.",
